Package: com.securitylab.pikminauto
Name: Pikmin Auto
Version: 0.4.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Own-device Pikmin Bloom automation — silently numbers all Pikmin in pluck order, and offers toggles to auto-harvest flower petals and auto-collect expedition rewards (fruit, seedlings, gifts) through the game's own RPCs. Nectar-feeding toggle runs a safe inventory check first.
Author: security-lab
Maintainer: security-lab
Section: Development
Depends: ellekit
